      ["Which word completes \"Tengo ___ sed\" (I'm very thirsty)?",["mucho","muy","mucha","muchos"],2,"sed is a feminine noun, so it takes mucha."],
      ["\"You speak very well\" is…",["Hablas mucho bien.","Hablas muy bien.","Hablas bien muy.","Hablas muy mucho."],1,"bien is a describing word, so muy goes right before it."]
