      ["Which form goes with nosotros?",["vamos a","van a","va a","voy a"],0,"nosotros takes vamos: vamos a viajar."],
      ["\"Are you going to travel on Saturday?\" (to a friend)",["¿Va a viajar en sábado?","¿Vas viajar el sábado?","¿Vas a viajas el sábado?","¿Vas a viajar el sábado?"],3,"vas for tú, then a + infinitive; days take el, not en."]
